 "insight": [
  "Luxembourg's imports of lifting and handling machinery in 2025 were 770.9 million euros in total.",
  "Japan was by far the largest supplier, providing 744.4 million euros worth, which is 96.6% of the imports.",
  "Germany was the second largest supplier with 5.8 million euros, followed by Slovakia with 3.4 million euros.",
  "The top three suppliers together accounted for 97.8% of the total imports.",
  "These values are nominal and not adjusted for price changes, which may affect comparisons over time."
 ],
